---
// Registration marks: four hairline corner ticks, the drawing-office
// convention used throughout the site's structural surfaces. Decorative only.
//
// Renders an absolutely positioned overlay, so the parent must be `relative`.
---

<span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0">
  <span class="absolute -top-px -left-px size-2.5 border-t border-l border-control"></span>
  <span class="absolute -top-px -right-px size-2.5 border-t border-r border-control"></span>
  <span class="absolute -bottom-px -left-px size-2.5 border-b border-l border-control"></span>
  <span class="absolute -right-px -bottom-px size-2.5 border-r border-b border-control"></span>
</span>
